The crash, and the attempt after it
Two columns showing the same interruption twice. On the left, work that is
started each time it is asked for: run one is interrupted halfway, run two
opens beside it, and there are now two accounts of one erasure. On the right,
work that is found if one is already open: run one is interrupted halfway, and
asking again resumes the same run, which closes when it finds nothing left to
do.
